  "details": "Description\n\nPressing the 'Y' key while typing closes the chat window.\n\nIn other words, you cannot type words containing the letter 'y' while chatting.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nTry typing a message after pressing the 'Y' key. It closes again the moment you press 'Y'. I guess it shouldn't accept Y key input when the chat window is open. : (\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 유저 인터페이스\n\n- Frequency: 항상\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1913-a070c3378e-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
